{"id": "tech-1", "headline": "OpenAI merges ChatGPT Chat and Work, shares one limit", "source": "TechCrunch", "url": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/25/openai-says-heavy-chatgpt-users-may-hit-limits-sooner-as-it-merges-chat-and-work/", "published": "2026-11-25", "url_verified": true, "pages": ["OpenAI has begun rolling out a combined Chat and Work experience in ChatGPT to a small group of Pro subscribers, product lead Thibault Sottiaux said on Tuesday. Chat and Work will draw on a single shared usage meter. Some subscribers worry the change will leave them less access to advanced reasoning models at the same price. An OpenAI spokesperson said most users should not see more frequent resets, but a small fraction of the heaviest users may reach their limits sooner. Conversations with the Instant model stay unlimited and do not count toward the shared allowance, and users can keep using Instant after hitting their limits.", "OpenAI plans to bring the shared limits to more users in December and says it will keep improving efficiency. Source: TechCrunch."], "qr": {"n": 41, "rows": ["11111110010110101011100100100011001111111", "10000010110110010010111010111000001000001", "10111010011100110010111100101000001011101", "10111010110100010010001111100101001011101", "10111010001010111010010110101101101011101", "10000010100100100010110010011100001000001", "11111110101010101010101010101010101111111", "00000000010000001001111000111011100000000", "11111011100001001101001011000101010101010", "11111101101111001101110100100011111111011", "11010110010011111100010001010110111110000", "01000000000011001110011000001011000111000", "01100110000000111001001001110110000001101", "10010101011011010011000100001011101110101", "01010110000000111100110000011110110110000", "10100100111010110011011010111001101101010", "00011110010011110101000011001101000000100", "10101001111100101001100100000111111110011", "00011110110000010010101011110000000010010", "10001001100000111000110010100001110111000", "010111